bin/
*.sock
.tmp/

# Stray build artifact: `go build` in the repo root drops a binary named after the
# plug. Nothing consumes it — the deploy rail builds into bin/ — and leaving it
# untracked made every stage report source_commit "<sha>-dirty", which is the one
# signal that says "the bytes built are not the bytes this commit names".
/plug-koreader
*.test
